quipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":["WJ10275"]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,66,55,53,55,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":["WJ10275"]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,66,55,53,55,53],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":["WJ10275"]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10048","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,66,55,53,55,53],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1008808","name":{"zh":"乱武后处理2","en":"Aftermath of the Revolt 2"},"year":"196","month":"6","desc":{"zh":"张济死亡","en":"Death of Zhang Ji"}}],"biography":{"zh":"董卓武将，张绣叔父。董卓被吕布杀害后，与李傕、郭汜等人一同占领长安，罪杀王允后拥立献帝，领镖骑将军屯守弘农。与樊稠共同击退马腾与韩遂的进攻。李傕、郭汜二人的矛盾日益激化的情况下，与长安众臣一同前去调和。次年出征期间中暗箭身亡，势力由其侄子张绣继承。","tc":"董卓武將，張繡叔父。董卓被呂布殺害后，與李傕、郭汜等人一同占領長安，罪殺王允后擁立獻帝，領鏢騎將軍屯守弘農。與樊稠共同擊退馬騰與韓遂的進攻。李傕、郭汜二人的矛盾日益激化的情況下，與長安眾臣一同前去調和。次年出征期間中暗箭身亡，勢力由其侄子張繡繼承。","en":"An officer under Dong Zhuo and uncle of Zhang Xiu. After Dong Zhuo was killed by Lu Bu, he joined Li Jue, Guo Si, and others in seizing Changan. After executing Wang Yun, they enthroned Emperor Xian, and he was appointed General of Agile Cavalry, garrisoning Hongnong. Alongside Fan Chou, he repelled an attack by Ma Teng and Han Sui. When the conflict between Li Jue and Guo Si intensified, he went with other ministers of Changan to mediate. The following year, he was struck by a stray arrow while on campaign and died, his faction was inherited by his nephew Zhang Xiu.","jp":"董卓配下の武将であり、張繍の叔父。董卓が呂布に殺害された後、李傕や郭汜らとともに長安を占領し、王允を罪に問うて処刑した後に献帝を擁立、驃騎将軍となって弘農に駐屯した。樊稠とともに馬騰と韓遂の侵攻を撃退した。李傕と郭汜の対立が激化すると、長安の群臣とともにその仲裁にあたった。翌年の出陣中に流れ矢を受けて戦死し、勢力は甥の張繍が継承した。","kr":"동탁 휘하의 무장이자 장수의 숙부이다. 동탁이 여포에게 살해된 후 이각, 곽사 등과 함께 장안을 점령하고, 왕윤에게 죄를 물어 처형한 뒤 헌제를 옹립하여 표기장군으로서 홍농에 주둔했다. 이후 번조와 함께 마등과 한수의 침공을 격퇴했다. 이각과 곽사의 갈등이 날로 격화되자 장안의 여러 신하들과 함께 중재에 나섰다. 이듬해 출진 도중 암전에 맞아 숨졌으며, 세력은 조카인 장수가 계승했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10273","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"济","nameTc":"濟","nameEn":"Ji","nameJp":"済","nameKr":"제","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张济","power":"WJ10048","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1031","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"66","wise":"55","politics":"53","charm":"55","will":"53","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"25/65/25/25/25/17/50/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1022102","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1005101","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"3000","strategy":"1000301;1003401","strategy2":"1005201","professions":"0/0/3/0/0/0/2/0/1/0/0/1/2/0/3/0/1/2/0/1/0/1/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"98","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7250","evaluate":"-4000","title":"","rank":"6","birth":"144","show":"184","death":"196","